        "text": "Both 40 mm and 60 mm candidates retain actual coarse and refined numerical temperature fields with the declared dimensions.",
        "scope": "content",
        "sources": [
          {
            "artifact_ref": "tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/alternatives.csv",
